"This filter answers where a matching Blueprint is known. Personal uses fresh Blueprint snapshots from connected characters. Corporation uses exact Blueprint type IDs from enabled corporation-hangar asset snapshots; ESI cannot distinguish BPO and BPC there. Not owned is accepted only when every required source is complete and no match exists. Unknown keeps candidates visible when a snapshot is missing, stale, partial or forbidden. These choices only filter the list; they neither reserve a Blueprint nor add a Blueprint cost." = "This filter answers where a matching Blueprint is known. Personal uses fresh Blueprint snapshots from connected characters. Corporation uses exact Blueprint type IDs from enabled corporation-hangar asset snapshots; ESI cannot distinguish BPO and BPC there. Not owned is accepted only when every required source is complete and no match exists. Unknown keeps candidates visible when a snapshot is missing, stale, partial or forbidden. These choices only filter the list; they neither reserve a Blueprint nor add a Blueprint cost.";
"This filter answers which personal Blueprint type or external source is acceptable. BPOs and BPCs apply to personal Blueprint snapshots; corporation assets cannot prove copy or original status. Loyalty Store BPCs intersects the list with products offered by the saved public LP catalog. Refreshing the LP catalog is an explicit ESI action; later switches are local. No option invents acquisition, copying or invention cost; enter an explicit allocation under Costs and budget when it should affect profit." = "This filter answers which personal Blueprint type or external source is acceptable. BPOs and BPCs apply to personal Blueprint snapshots; corporation assets cannot prove copy or original status. Loyalty Store BPCs intersects the list with products offered by the saved public LP catalog. Refreshing the LP catalog is an explicit ESI action; later switches are local. No option invents acquisition, copying or invention cost; enter an explicit allocation under Costs and budget when it should affect profit.";
"Select broad product families. Multiple choices within this card are combined with OR; this card is combined with Production class, Catalog, Blueprint and Result by AND. Changes filter the saved scan locally and do not start ESI or SDE work. Other preserves complete recipes that cannot be classified into one listed family." = "Select broad product families. Multiple choices within this card are combined with OR; this card is combined with Production class, Catalog, Blueprint and Result by AND. Changes filter the saved scan locally and do not start ESI or SDE work. Other preserves complete recipes that cannot be classified into one listed family.";
"Uses factual SDE meta-group and tech-level metadata to limit results to Tech I, Tech II, Tech III, faction, storyline or other. Multiple choices inside this card use OR; other active filter cards use AND. Missing metadata stays Other or unclassified and is never guessed from the item name. If the warning appears, update the SDE and run the Main Hub scan again before expecting exact class filtering." = "Uses factual SDE meta-group and tech-level metadata to limit results to Tech I, Tech II, Tech III, faction, storyline or other. Multiple choices inside this card use OR; other active filter cards use AND. Missing metadata stays Other or unclassified and is never guessed from the item name. If the warning appears, update the SDE and run the Main Hub scan again before expecting exact class filtering.";
