"Select one exact SDE category and group from the saved Main Hub scan. Category and group use AND with each other and with Product, Production class, Blueprint ownership and Result. Changing them is a local list filter and does not refresh market or SDE data. All categories or All groups disables only that respective restriction." = "Select one exact SDE category and group from the saved Main Hub scan. Category and group use AND with each other and with Product, Production class, Blueprint ownership and Result. Changing them is a local list filter and does not refresh market or SDE data. All categories or All groups disables only that respective restriction.";
"Favorites keeps only starred products. Value limits rows by their already calculated profit state. Minimum average daily demand uses the known multi-day average: zero disables the threshold and keeps unavailable averages; a positive number accepts only known averages at or above it. Sorting remains controlled by the clickable table headings and missing values stay distinct from zero." = "Favorites keeps only starred products. Value limits rows by their already calculated profit state. Minimum average daily demand uses the known multi-day average: zero disables the threshold and keeps unavailable averages; a positive number accepts only known averages at or above it. Sorting remains controlled by the clickable table headings and missing values stay distinct from zero.";
"Market material replacement value, installation, Profile logistics, sales tax and broker fee are applied automatically from the saved scan and Profile. Blueprint allocation is optional and affects every required run only when enabled with a valid ISK amount. Maximum material purchases limits only new wallet cash for material shortfalls; Warehouse stock keeps its replacement value but does not consume this limit. Missing market, Warehouse, volume, fee or logistics data remains unavailable and is never replaced by zero." = "Market material replacement value, installation, Profile logistics, sales tax and broker fee are applied automatically from the saved scan and Profile. Blueprint allocation is optional and affects every required run only when enabled with a valid ISK amount. Maximum material purchases limits only new wallet cash for material shortfalls; Warehouse stock keeps its replacement value but does not consume this limit. Missing market, Warehouse, volume, fee or logistics data remains unavailable and is never replaced by zero.";
"Blueprint allocation is enabled, but the amount is empty or invalid. Enter the complete ISK allocation per required Blueprint run. Until then, cost, profit, ROI and ISK rates that depend on this allocation remain unavailable instead of treating the Blueprint as free." = "Blueprint allocation is enabled, but the amount is empty or invalid. Enter the complete ISK allocation per required Blueprint run. Until then, cost, profit, ROI and ISK rates that depend on this allocation remain unavailable instead of treating the Blueprint as free.";
"The material-purchase limit must be empty or a non-negative ISK amount. It limits only new wallet cash for material shortfalls. Invalid input does not become zero and cannot silently exclude every candidate." = "The material-purchase limit must be empty or a non-negative ISK amount. It limits only new wallet cash for material shortfalls. Invalid input does not become zero and cannot silently exclude every candidate.";
