"Gross revenue: lowest active sell-order price at the exact Main Hub multiplied by the complete scenario output. No tax or fee has been deducted yet. Click to sort." = "Gross revenue: lowest active sell-order price at the exact Main Hub multiplied by the complete scenario output. No tax or fee has been deducted yet. Click to sort.";
